The `edits` value, once the outer `arguments` string is parsed, is:

```
"[{\"newText\":\"const x = { \"color\": 0xff0000 };\",\"oldText\":\"const x = { \"color\": 0x3366ff };\"}]"
```

This is a string, not an array. The `color` property name has also gained quotes it did not have in the original input (`color` -> `"color"`), suggesting something is re-encoding the content.

